        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we have agreed to continue to provide Kura Japan with certain translational support services and market research analyses.",
        "start_character": 17171,
        "end_character": 17306
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-269773",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-269773-b9a950785da93bff",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-269773",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-06",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "On August 5, 2019, we entered into a Shared Services Agreement with Kura Japan, pursuant to which Kura Japan provides us with certain strategic, operational and other support services, including assigning certain employees to work for us as expatriates to provide support to our operations, sending its employees to us on a short-term basis to provide support for the opening of new restaurants or renovation of existing restaurants, and providing us with certain supplies, parts and equipment for use in our restaurants.",
        "start_character": 16649,
        "end_character": 17170
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-269773",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-269773-b9a950785da93bff",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-269773",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-06",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that establishing the operations team has enabled our restaurant managers to focus on guest service and efficient operations in our restaurants and has permitted a smaller regional management structure.",
        "start_character": 13961,
        "end_character": 14174
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-269773",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-269773-b9a950785da93bff",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-269773",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-06",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We require our local store management and service staff to take required responsible beverage service training through applicable state programs along with internal mandatory training providing proper guidance on minimizing risk of over serving or serving someone not of age.",
        "start_character": 30035,
        "end_character": 30310
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-269773",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-269773-b9a950785da93bff",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-269773",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-06",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are also subject in certain states to “dram shop” statutes, which generally provide a person injured by an intoxicated person the right to recover damages from an establishment that wrongfully served alcoholic beverages to the intoxicated person.",
        "start_character": 30311,
        "end_character": 30560
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-269773",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-269773-b9a950785da93bff",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-269773",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We consider site selection and real estate development to be critical to our success.",
        "start_character": 9359,
        "end_character": 9444
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-269773",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-269773-b9a950785da93bff",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-269773",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We frequently reevaluate our market area development plan (targeted areas and pacing for development) and our site selection strategy within those targeted areas.",
        "start_character": 11846,
        "end_character": 12008
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-269773",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-269773-b9a950785da93bff",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-269773",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-06",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We limit the amount of time that our dishes remain on the revolving conveyor belt to two hours, which is shorter than the time required by local health authorities where we operate our restaurants.",
        "start_character": 15938,
        "end_character": 16135
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-269773",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-269773-b9a950785da93bff",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-269773",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We operate each of our restaurants in accordance with standards and procedures designed to comply with applicable codes and regulations.",
        "start_character": 27524,
        "end_character": 27660
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-269773",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-269773-b9a950785da93bff",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-269773",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We use proprietary technology developed by Kura Japan to predict a restaurant’s food consumption.",
        "start_character": 21503,
        "end_character": 21600
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-269773",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-269773-b9a950785da93bff",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-269773",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-06",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We are also subject to laws and regulations relating to information security, privacy, cashless payments, gift cards and consumer credit, protection and fraud, and any failure or perceived failure to comply with these laws could harm our reputation or lead to litigation, which could adversely affect our business, financial condition or results of operations.",
